## Nomes simples ##


<div class="col75p terminal example">
&lt;form ...>

&lt;select onchange="this.form.<span class=focus>style.color</span>=this.value;">
&lt;option>
&lt;option>orange
&lt;option>DarkBlue
&lt;option>DarKSlateGrey
&lt;/select>
&lt;br> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet
&lt;/form>
</div>
<div class=col25p>

<form style="width: 200px; height: 200px; padding: 20px; font-size: 24pt;" onsubmit="return false;">

<select onchange="this.form.style.color = this.value;">
<option>
<option>orange
<option>DarkBlue
<option>DarKSlateGrey
</select>
<br> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet

</select>

</form>

</div>




* Nomes de propriedade CSS com apenas uma palavra
* Exemplos
    * <code class=focus>color</code>, <code class=focus>background</code>
    * <code class=focus>width</code>, <code class=focus>height</code>
* Na syntaxe CSS/JavaScript são **iguais**
